   "properties": {
    "description": "Money Heist: From Tokyo to Berlin (2021) is a short documentary that assembles cast members and filmmakers to reflect on the emotional and artistic work behind a globally popular crime drama. Featuring contributors such as Jesús Colmenar, Rodrigo de la Serna, and Pedro Alonso, the film blends interview footage and production clips to explore character interpretation and creative collaboration. Framed as a reflective behind-the-scenes piece, it emphasizes personal testimony and the craft of performance, directing, and design.",
